Dear Investor,

Before investing, verify the registration of the intermediary. Registered
intermediaries collecting investor funds must use a validated UPI address end=
ing
in .brk@valid for brokers or .mf@valid for mutual funds.

Never transfer investment money to a personal UPI handle or an individual's b=
ank
account, however convincing the request appears.
